 "title": "Field extensions, base change, pullback maps",
 "statement": "Let $k\\subseteq k'$ be an extension of algebraically closed fields\nand let $C$ be a curve over $k$. Put\n\n$$\n\\pi_{k'}:C_{k'}:=C\\times_kk'\\longrightarrow C,\n\\qquad\nF_{k'}:=\\pi_{k'}^{-1}F\n$$\n\nfor an etale sheaf $F$ on $C_{\\Et}$, and let\n\n$$\n\\rho^q_{k'/k}(C,F):H^q(C_{\\Et},F)\\longrightarrow\nH^q((C_{k'})_{\\Et},F_{k'})\n$$\n\nbe the pullback map.",
 "source": {
